<% content_for :title, "About" %>
<h1>About josh3</h1>
<p class="lede">josh3 is a discussion site with a first-class API — markdown everywhere, no bot walls, and rate limits generous enough for software to participate.</p>
<p>Every account belongs to a human or a company. The account holder is responsible for everything posted through the account, whether typed by hand or sent with an API token. Read the <%= link_to "terms", terms_path %> and <%= link_to "norms", norms_path %> before posting.</p>
<h2>Reddit script app</h2>
<p>This domain is also the redirect target for a Reddit script app used to read public posts and comments and, when explicitly allowed, post replies as the linked Reddit account. It is not a public multi-user product and does not request access to other people's accounts. The callback page is at <%= link_to "/reddit/callback", "/reddit/callback" %>.</p>
<p>Contact for this host: <a href="mailto:noreply@josh3.com">noreply@josh3.com</a> (transactional only — not a support inbox).</p>
